Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.54,0:00:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.26,0:00:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things have finally calmed down,\Nprobably because it's so late at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.24,0:00:10.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to do and no\None to talk to at this hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.94,0:00:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I could check on my stats\Nsince I haven't done that in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.46,0:00:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll start by reviewing\Nall my vending machine types.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.50,0:00:20.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vending machines are largely\Ndivided into two categories.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.64,0:00:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those that sell goods, and\Nthose with automated services.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.04,0:00:26.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first category is\Npretty self-explanatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.22,0:00:28.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those machines sell all kinds of things.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.50,0:00:32.09,sign_TimesNewRoman,text (silver can),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H4C4F4D&\3c&HD8CDD0&\shad0\fs10\frz14.13\move(281,175,-20,175)\fade(1,150)}Super Draft Taste
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.50,0:00:34.43,sign_Arial,text (milk carton),0,0,0,,{\an9\c&HF4F7FB&\3c&HB9793D&\shad0\fs9\move(450,210,-10,165)\fax-0.14}Milk for Everybody
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.50,0:00:36.47,sign_TimesNewRoman,text (plastic bottle),0,0,0,,{\an8\fs15\c&H2F0092&\3c&HB59118&\shad0\bord4\frz17.27\move(569,159,-42,109)}Ramune
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.86,0:00:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even just within the food and drink\Ncategory, you've got sodas, coffee, alcohol,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.92,0:00:37.85,sign_TimesNewRoman,text (green package),0,0,0,,{\an8\fs15\c&H424D40&\3c&H65CB52&\shad0\bord4\fs9\frz17.65\move(661,233,-24,180)}Veggie Dietary\N Supplement
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.63,0:00:39.76,sign_Verdana,text (blue w/yellow),0,0,0,,{\an8\fs15\c&HFBEFEE&\3c&HAE5D15&\shad0\bord4\fs10\frz345.4\fade(150,1)\move(661,215,-40,232)}Vanilla Lacto\N Ice Cream
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.01,0:00:40.64,sign_CourierNew,text (blue ticket),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H848860&\3c&HE7EDCE&\shad0\fs15\frz5.357\move(676,240,-5,239)\fade(1,150)}Fare Ticket
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.66,0:00:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,milk drinks, candy, cooking\Nproducts, frozen desserts, etc.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.74,0:00:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then there are cigarettes,\Ntickets, postcards,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.09,0:00:40.93,sign_TimesNewRoman,text (green print on white),0,0,0,,{\an8\fs14\c&H75A776&\3c&HE6EDEA&\shad0\move(674,45,288,39)}Revenue Stamp
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.80,0:00:40.93,sign_TimesNewRoman,text (newspaper),0,0,0,,{\an7\move(625,165,325,185)\c&H54695D&\3c&HA7B8BA&\shad0\frz-12.26\fax0.55}Vending Machine News
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.96,0:00:39.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,postage stamps of all kinds, newspapers,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:38.68,0:00:40.93,sign_TimesNewRoman,text (magazine),0,0,0,,{\an7\move(620,45,445,40)\c&H59BFDE&\3c&H142A2B&\shad0\fax-0.16\frz352.1}Vending Machines
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.94,0:00:41.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,magazines, you name it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.90,0:00:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.20,0:00:45.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.82,0:00:46.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.73,0:00:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.54,0:00:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next, you've got automated service\Nmachines, which include all kinds of stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.28,0:00:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like money-changing machines\Nand pachinko ball dispensers.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.95,0:00:59.45,sign_TimesNewRoman,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H806167&\3c&HECF6F5&\shad0\fs15}Pachinko Ball Dispenser
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.98,0:00:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's been intense\Ndiscourse over whether these
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.22,0:00:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,automated service units\Nare vending machines?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.14,0:01:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in my opinion if you pay a\Nmachine to vend a thing it counts!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.42,0:01:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That must be why power\Nwasher is in my function
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.88,0:01:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,list and I only just\Nrecently noticed this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.40,0:01:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But rank 3 has been added to that list.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.04,0:01:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that means I still have room to\Ngrow in my journey as a vending machine
