Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.46,0:01:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To attain rank 3 I would\Nneed 3 million points.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.22,0:01:16.22,sign_CourierNew,text (top),0,0,0,,{\c&HF5ECED&\bord0\shad0\fs40\an7\pos(51,115)}Boxxo
