Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.22,0:01:18.72,sign_CourierNew,text,0,0,0,,{\c&HF5ECED&\bord0\shad0\fs40\an1\pos(61,118)}Points needed
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.90,0:01:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't even know what\Nthat would let me do
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.72,0:01:21.22,sign_CourierNew,text,0,0,0,,{\c&HF5ECED&\bord0\shad0\fs40\an7\pos(51,115)}Boxxo
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.72,0:01:21.22,sign_CourierNew,text (bottom),0,0,0,,{\c&HF5ECED&\bord0\shad0\fs40\an1\pos(242,236)}Rank 3
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.34,0:01:21.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.38,0:01:23.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get to chase my vending machine dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.98,0:01:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having goals makes me so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.76,0:01:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know it's fried chicken,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.10,0:01:42.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I can't pronounce it well so fried\Nchicken is what ended up sticking!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.14,0:01:47.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, alright, relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.88,0:01:49.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's plenty to go around
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.09,0:01:54.00,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.86,0:02:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the outside, I'm just a big metal box,\Nbut inside, I've still got a human soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.74,0:02:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this new world of wonders,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.39,0:02:07.27,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(1773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.00,0:02:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I travel to and fro on the back\Nof my super strong partner,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.02,0:02:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.93,0:02:07.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name's Boxxo. Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.16,0:02:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means yes, by the way.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.09,0:03:27.97,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(357,450)\fscx80\pos(476.2,53.4)}Respective Wishes
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.60,0:03:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hume and me stayed up all night\Nfixing the transfer circle,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.66,0:03:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we've started evacuating the\Nresidents of the Origin Stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.28,0:03:34.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their place of refuge will be\Nthe Clear Flow Lake Stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.00,0:03:39.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, I still don't\Nknow how many strata this dungeon has.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.82,0:03:43.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.94,0:03:45.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right, how many strata?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.90,0:03:47.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, starting from the top,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.80,0:03:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's the Origin Stratum,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.44,0:03:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Dead's Lament Stratum, Clearflow\NLake Stratum, The Labyrinth Stratum,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.36,0:03:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scorching Sand Stratum, Dark Forest\NStratum, and then Dog Mountain Stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.02,0:04:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.24,0:04:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Below that is the Everlasting\NStratum, which is yet to be conquered.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.16,0:04:09.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So at this point, we know there\Nare at least eight stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.26,0:04:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's begin the evacuation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.40,0:04:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, the transfer circle\Nseems to be working just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.22,0:04:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raises the question, what\Ndo we do with it after this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.92,0:04:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we just abandon it and\Nthe monsters misuse it,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.68,0:04:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it'll cause a lot of\Ntrouble for other strata.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.00,0:04:40.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could hunt down the\NNetherlord's underling
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.16,0:04:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and break their control over the monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.14,0:04:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would solve the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.92,0:04:44.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Theoretically, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.83,0:04:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't afford to spare the manpower\Nit would require to hunt them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.10,0:04:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, in that case, how about\Ntrusting the hunting parts,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.02,0:04:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the esteemed menagerie of\Nfools and band of gluttons.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.96,0:04:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does he think being\Ndashing will have his case?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.46,0:04:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're willing to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.88,0:04:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be happy to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.98,0:05:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to gather more info\Non the Neverborn anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.20,0:05:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said, it's going to cost you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.18,0:05:06.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.26,0:05:08.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The better the results,\Nthe higher the reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.88,0:05:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was going to do it even\Nif she refused to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.78,0:05:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mishuel's really got the moves, huh, Akka?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.06,0:05:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure wish we had a\Nflashy attack like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.32,0:05:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, water, become Whirlpools and fear!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.60,0:05:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incredible fighting there, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.14,0:05:44.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo, might I trouble you for\Na little something to drink?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:45.74,0:05:46.99,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text,0,0,0,,{\fs25\c&H9B6444&\3c&HE7B195&}Kocha Kadan
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.94,0:05:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.72,0:05:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, seeing how my primary function is\Nhealing, I have no arsenal of offensive magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.32,0:05:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which essentially means I\Nam a bystander in combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.18,0:06:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We each have our own roles to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.44,0:06:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if he's serious or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.84,0:06:05.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heavy's face is particularly hard to read.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:06.26,0:06:09.72,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\fscx90\an2\pos(320,295)\fad(1,438)}Deep within the Origin stratum
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.52,0:06:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, which way do we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.28,0:06:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The map says there's a small\Nlake not far ahead to the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.84,0:06:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the other hand, if we\Ngo left, it's a long haul,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.72,0:06:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and there's a three-way\Nsplit in the path from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.54,0:06:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we should check out the\Nlake first, but from there, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.30,0:06:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.48,0:06:27.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't we just pause to chat\Nwithout some jerks showing up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.56,0:06:29.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.47,0:06:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heavy, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.52,0:06:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous to get that close!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.32,0:06:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pay it no mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.54,0:06:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heavy, hold your horses!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.86,0:06:35.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fret not, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.77,0:06:37.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll handle this. Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.54,0:06:38.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suit yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.42,0:06:44.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.78,0:06:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are they looking around for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.90,0:06:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why aren't the monsters attacking?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.42,0:06:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll bet they might see walls that\Nare invisible to us. That's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.10,0:06:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heavy excels in magic\Nthat manipulates light.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.74,0:06:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This allows him to produce illusions,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.38,0:07:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he's also able to influence\Nthe mind more directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.02,0:07:03.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.93,0:07:06.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like when he hid those\Npeople in the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.66,0:07:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no interest in those who go\Nbarefoot, so there's no need to spare these.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.26,0:07:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has the blessing of might too,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.50,0:07:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,though I will say it's not\Nas strong as Llama says.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.82,0:07:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, no mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.60,0:07:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's safe to say\NHeavy's got this handled.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.76,0:07:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, I think we should\Nsplit up into two groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.64,0:07:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be pretty dumb if we\Nall searched in one direction
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.16,0:07:44.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they got past us just by\Ncoming from the other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.02,0:07:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's all the same to you, Captain,\NI wish to accompany the lake group.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.60,0:07:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, where should we go, Boxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.02,0:07:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I'm concerned for\Neveryone in the heavy group.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.02,0:07:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I had to choose...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:56.28,0:07:58.12,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(195,20)\fad(500,1)}Megumi Natural Water
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.72,0:07:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That took way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.66,0:07:59.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you want to go to the lake?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.86,0:08:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.14,0:08:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alrighty then, Captain,\Nwe're going to the lake too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.20,0:08:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.58,0:08:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This search party only\Nincludes half our members,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.88,0:08:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we managed to wipe\Nthese guys out in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.48,0:08:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, the lake water's\Ncrystal clear. My friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.96,0:08:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we seem to be making excellent time,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.00,0:08:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so why don't you all take a\Nbreak and get in the water?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.36,0:08:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, majorly sus.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.36,0:08:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The others are waiting on us,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.16,0:08:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we'd better hurry back\Nthe captain said we needed to
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.86,0:08:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be back in about three hours\NAnd we're well within that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.86,0:08:33.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.77,0:08:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.76,0:08:37.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know you guys\Ncan stand there debating
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.88,0:08:40.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.84,0:08:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, they seem tempted to\Njoin in danger, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.46,0:08:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.92,0:08:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will be right here on the shore standing\Nguard I think even just dipping your
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.00,0:08:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,feet in the water and washing your hair\Nwould make you feel quite refreshed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.16,0:09:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that sounds nice.\NWant to, Lamas? Well, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.74,0:09:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little dip can't hurt, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.44,0:09:05.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait here for a bit, Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.74,0:09:08.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.65,0:09:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,form change!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:09.40,0:09:10.32,sign_Verdana,text (red),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H3219AC&\shad0\bord2}Mr. Pressure
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.08,0:09:11.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.18,0:09:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is no place to leave these.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.26,0:09:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone might come along and steal them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.70,0:09:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had better keep an eye\Nout while the girls swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.12,0:09:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I can't help but wonder,\Nwhat do both their shoes smell like?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.12,0:09:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I called it! Too bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.32,0:09:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Saw that coming from a mile away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.02,0:09:34.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you get some\Nrefreshment too, Heavy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.94,0:09:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And wash your dirty\Nmind while you're at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.72,0:09:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, we're back! Hi there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.58,0:09:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, glad to see you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.36,0:09:45.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, Heavy, why are you soaking wet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.48,0:09:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just fell in the lake for\Npurely personal reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.32,0:09:50.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving that one alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.36,0:09:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe it's about time for lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.06,0:09:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo, if you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.68,0:09:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be happy to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.96,0:10:02.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, I want to try out a new function\NI think you guys will appreciate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.58,0:10:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Form change!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.68,0:10:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a vending machine\Nmarket where you can
Dialogue: 1,0:10:05.12,0:10:09.21,sign_Arial,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HA48B52&\3c&HECEFEC&\shad0\bord4}Family Market
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.86,0:10:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,buy convenient store items 24 hours a day.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:09.21,0:10:10.46,sign_Arial,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H293723&\3c&H3B8938&\shad0\bord4}Rice Ball
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.42,0:10:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I get to show off my knack for\Narranging things with limited space.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:10.46,0:10:11.71,sign_Arial,text (center),0,0,0,,{\an2\c&H282D2B&\3c&HBCBEBE&\fs15\shad0\fs8\pos(325,205)}Chili Shrimp Fried Rice
Dialogue: 1,0:10:11.71,0:10:12.96,sign_Arial,text (left),0,0,0,,{\an2\c&H282D2B&\3c&HBCBEBE&\fs15\shad0\fs8\pos(322,188)}Chukadon
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.96,0:10:13.71,sign_Verdana,text (center yellow),0,0,0,,{\c&H9FA69A&\3c&H367F9A&\shad0\fs15\move(308,184,308,184,27,-15)}Fruit Milk
Dialogue: 1,0:10:13.71,0:10:16.47,sign_Verdana,text (lower left),0,0,0,,{\c&H9FA0B2&\3c&H5D5399&\shad0\fs8\pos(88,158)}Strawberry Milk
Dialogue: 1,0:10:13.71,0:10:17.72,sign_Verdana,text (lower center),0,0,0,,{\c&H9FA0B2&\3c&H347C96&\shad0\fs8\pos(312,208)}Fruit Milk
Dialogue: 1,0:10:13.71,0:10:17.72,sign_Verdana,text (lower right),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H9987C3&\3c&HB5B9B8&\shad0\fs13\pos(541,52)}Yogurt
Dialogue: 1,0:10:13.71,0:10:17.72,sign_Verdana,text (upper center),0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(316,52)\c&H706C76&\3c&HA7ADB5&\shad0\fs10}Cream Puff
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.96,0:10:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so here's the ideal lineup.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:16.26,0:10:19.76,sign_Arial,text (middle),0,0,0,,{\c&H6F726F&\3c&HC4BFBD&\shad0\fs10\an8\pos(330,17)}Ham Sandwich
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.50,0:10:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come taste the wonders of a vending\Nmachine-turned-mini-convenient store!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:18.88,0:10:19.76,sign_Arial,text (left),0,0,0,,{\c&H6F726F&\3c&HC4BFBD&\shad0\fs10\an8\pos(130,17)}Egg Sandwich
Dialogue: 1,0:10:18.88,0:10:21.22,sign_Arial,text (right),0,0,0,,{\c&H6F726F&\3c&HC4BFBD&\shad0\fs8\an8\pos(526,20)}Assorted Sandwiches
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.22,0:10:21.22,sign_Arial,text (top row),0,0,0,,{\an7\fs15\c&H2D3C21&\3c&H589A49&\shad0\fs10\pos(77,46)}Rice Ball
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.60,0:10:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.51,0:10:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is a treasure trove of delight!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.24,0:10:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there are foods in there\NI've never even heard of before!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.88,0:10:29.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means I'll just have to try them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.06,0:10:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, it all looks so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.08,0:10:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, we will have to sample\Neverything, won't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.64,0:10:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where should we start, Akka?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.96,0:10:42.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's each choose different\Nitems and then go halfsy, Shiro!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.32,0:10:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh wait, they probably don't know how to\Nopen a rice ball, so I should demonstrate.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:45.16,0:10:49.50,sign_TimesNewRoman,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H4B5761&\3c&H587FF2&\shad0\ord4\pos(318,121)}Plum Rice Ball
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.24,0:10:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon me, comrades?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.52,0:11:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do apologize, but like that,\Ncan I get some help over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.26,0:11:05.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fatiguing and alarming right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.82,0:11:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo, Boxo.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:07.93,0:11:10.02,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,text,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(189,1)\an8\fs20\pos(490,142)}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N {\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.18,0:11:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.94,0:11:13.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.04,0:11:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll probably find them\Nsomewhere down this hill.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.03,0:11:20.49,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\fscx90\an2\pos(320,295)\fad(1,438)}Deepest part of the Origin stratum
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.08,0:11:18.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, most likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.94,0:11:22.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mishuel, can you tell how many\Nbeings might be down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.12,0:11:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're too close together\Nfor me to count accurately.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.10,0:11:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That being said, we should be\Nprepared for at least a hundred.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.32,0:11:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's all? Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.32,0:11:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't get our butts handed to\Nus even if we charge right in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.18,0:11:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mishuel, you and I will take the lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.12,0:11:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.36,0:11:39.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there anything I can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.94,0:11:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could I slow down the monsters somehow?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.46,0:11:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know just the thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.78,0:11:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Form change!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.52,0:11:49.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Boxxo, what's going on?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:51.39,0:11:52.56,sign_TimesNewRoman,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H53191D&\3c&HECF6F5&\shad0\fs20}Pachinko Ball Dispenser
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.42,0:11:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is kind of incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.66,0:12:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Boxo, can you tell\Nme what these balls are?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.40,0:12:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too close for comfort there, Mishuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.36,0:12:08.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.27,0:12:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if they try to charge, they'll just slip\Non these little balls and fall down?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.68,0:12:12.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cut off. Act.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.18,0:12:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should declare Lamas the\Nofficial Boxxo interpreter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.74,0:12:20.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I hear monsters\Nscreaming from that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.64,0:12:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They sound weird, though,\Nand there's lots of noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.06,0:12:23.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.97,0:12:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems like Boxxo set the stage for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.80,0:12:27.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get in there, people!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.22,0:12:28.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.88,0:12:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there's this many of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.96,0:12:33.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet the commander's in there somewhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.30,0:12:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let the battle begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.30,0:12:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roaring strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.92,0:12:41.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I could only grow to\Nbe as strong as Mishuel,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.78,0:12:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just know I'd be a lot more help\Nto everyone in times like these.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.92,0:12:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're fine, Lammis.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:49.62,0:12:53.29,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text (white),0,0,0,,{\fad(1,500)\fs25\c&H9B6444&\3c&HE7B195&}Kocha Kadan
Dialogue: 1,0:12:49.62,0:12:53.29,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text (yellow),0,0,0,,{\fad(1,500)\an9\c&H00212C&\3c&H245E69&\fs20}Early Afternoon Tea
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.94,0:12:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, I'd better get busy. Recently,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.28,0:12:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I realized I can switch out\Ngoods to get access to this
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.68,0:12:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,candy without turning into the\Nspecialized vending machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.76,0:13:00.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never know these\Nthings unless you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.78,0:13:01.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Launch!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.08,0:13:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo, can you maybe handle\Nthe enemies behind us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.08,0:13:10.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.40,0:13:13.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Letting me cover her back\Nis proof that she trusts me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.98,0:13:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a man's job to live up to that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.72,0:13:19.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I now know that this works\Ngreat as a blunt weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.94,0:13:24.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I'll use it to take out any enemy\Nthat tries to attack Lammis from behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.94,0:13:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glory! Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.26,0:13:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They just keep coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.60,0:13:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't win if new guys keep showing\Nup as fast as we can take them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.28,0:13:38.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to locate the commander somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.30,0:13:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might as well try asking Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.26,0:13:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lammis is... You called? Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.72,0:13:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Us, the people, they're there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.50,0:13:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, wait, you want me\Nto throw you over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.28,0:13:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way! I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.84,0:13:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to use you like\Nyou're just some object!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.00,0:13:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a partner. Partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.98,0:13:59.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we are partners, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.60,0:14:02.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, as your partner,\Nallow me to say this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.74,0:14:03.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.78,0:14:04.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.12,0:14:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo, are you trying to put yourself\Nin harm's way out of concern for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.40,0:14:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here I am, doing the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.44,0:14:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never want you to get hurt,\Nand I'd do anything to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.74,0:14:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.24,0:14:18.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suori, be!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.16,0:14:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.74,0:14:21.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our hearts beat as one after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.04,0:14:23.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I attack, and you defend!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.16,0:14:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together, we can do anything! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.84,0:14:28.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From now on, we'll work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.32,0:14:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll determine a suitable\Nstrategy for every situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.40,0:14:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so, let's work together now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.24,0:14:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can launch a suicide attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.08,0:14:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, did I hear you right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.82,0:14:39.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that's a little\Nextreme, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.80,0:14:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas, Master Boxo, if you're coming\Nthrough, allow me to clear a path.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.14,0:14:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Boxxo, feel free to proceed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.40,0:14:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you feel free to stop us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.60,0:14:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Mishuel, that's Boxo's\Nnumber one offenses for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.88,0:14:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, please, no need for flattery.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.00,0:14:59.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mishuel seems bolstered by the compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.64,0:15:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welp, here goes nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.58,0:15:10.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To incapacitate enemies without defeating\Nthem, that calls for pachinko balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.56,0:15:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The best product for slipping and\Nfalling would have to be these. Launch!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.96,0:15:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, this is kind of fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.36,0:15:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More balls coming at ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.22,0:15:29.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.13,0:15:30.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That takes care of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.68,0:15:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo, where's the commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.46,0:15:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all green fiends.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.00,0:15:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see anything that\Nlooks like a commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.14,0:15:36.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.08,0:15:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.36,0:15:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mikenne! You okay? What happened?\NThanks, Slomus. Hey, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.58,0:15:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before, I heard what sounded like\Nhuman screams coming from over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.98,0:15:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it was inside that mound.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.20,0:15:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's still faint moans\Ncoming out of it. Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.66,0:16:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That first attack must have done the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.72,0:16:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, form change!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:03.56,0:16:04.44,sign_Arial,text (black left),0,0,0,,{\an4\fs10\c&H040C0B&\bord0\shad0\frz10.89\pos(57,232)}Coin-Op\NPower Washer
Dialogue: 1,0:16:03.56,0:16:04.44,sign_Arial,text (black right),0,0,0,,{\an1\c&H000100&\shad0\pos(378,65)\frz14.7\fs17\3c&H879196&}Osugi Cleaning Factory
Dialogue: 1,0:16:03.56,0:16:04.44,sign_Verdana,text (orange),0,0,0,,{\an1\c&H17498C&\3c&H040104&\shad0\frz21.88\fs40\pos(16,119)}Refreshing
Dialogue: 1,0:16:03.56,0:16:04.44,sign_Verdana,text (red),0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(252,274)\frz13.85\fs40\c&H20117A&\3c&H0B100F&\shad0\bord4}Mr. Pressure
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.70,0:16:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Power washer!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.74,0:16:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There and there, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.18,0:16:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll go check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.60,0:16:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wait right here. Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.88,0:16:18.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.78,0:16:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's the commander! Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.16,0:16:27.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When all your attacks can't\Nstop them, you go for the ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.18,0:16:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's one less thing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.32,0:16:37.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Boxo, we cleared a path of retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.04,0:16:39.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, go back to the pathway.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.92,0:16:44.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, since we've made it this\Nfar, that's mission accomplished.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.26,0:16:47.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With Kerioyl here, we'll question\Nher once we get back to the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.46,0:16:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.42,0:16:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But should you be taking advantage of this
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.48,0:16:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trying situation by\Npatting a woman's rear?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.90,0:16:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.81,0:16:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just caught up in the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.73,0:16:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.64,0:16:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like I\Npremeditated it or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.02,0:16:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.42,0:17:00.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those two are really adorable together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.88,0:17:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What exactly is their\Nrelationship, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.36,0:17:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, you always act like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.02,0:17:06.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As vice-captain...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.93,0:17:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't they too old to be fighting\Nlike this in front of everyone, Akka?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.50,0:17:10.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Probably so.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.52,0:17:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's always so embarrassing\Nto watch, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.78,0:17:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does he mean, too old?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.42,0:17:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't Vice-Captain Filmina\Npretty young, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.68,0:17:18.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean you didn't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.56,0:17:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She might look young, but she's\Nolder than the captain, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.70,0:17:22.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.61,0:17:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's just no way that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.84,0:17:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, the vice-captain is half\Nsome race, one I can't remember now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.42,0:17:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The race in question is vamp fiend, Shui.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.80,0:17:31.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vamp fiend?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.86,0:17:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never even heard of that race.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.74,0:17:34.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.65,0:17:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From what I understand,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.70,0:17:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,vamp fiends are the race that survive\Nby feeding on people's blood, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.06,0:17:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they're all beautiful creatures\Nwho look just like humans?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:41.54,0:17:54.80,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text,0,0,0,,{\fs25\c&H9B6444&\3c&HD7DCE2&\an7}Kocha Kadan
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.66,0:17:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, and to add to that, vamp fiends\Nmay get nourishment in other ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.92,0:17:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from bodily fluids whose composition\Nis somewhat similar to blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.52,0:17:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which is why it isn't uncommon for them\Nto bond with humans and have children.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.62,0:17:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or so I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.60,0:17:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So romantic!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.98,0:17:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then those two are\Ndestined for each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.98,0:18:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blood thing doesn't bother you at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.36,0:18:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas, that's being with a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.42,0:18:05.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some call it an abomination.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.70,0:18:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems like that's not how they\Nthought Lamas would react.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.48,0:18:09.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.39,0:18:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just because someone's race or\Nappearance is different from your own,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.20,0:18:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that doesn't mean anything\Nabout who they are as a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.46,0:18:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Boxxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.54,0:18:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.92,0:18:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the Menagerie of\NFools has accepted her,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.40,0:18:21.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so she's just the same as everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.68,0:18:22.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.64,0:18:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are a bunch of oddballs, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.22,0:18:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just remembered.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.72,0:18:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't the Menagerie of Fools members\Nhave a few wishes they want granted?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.22,0:18:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would it be okay for me to\Nask what those wishes are?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.00,0:18:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.00,0:18:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I forget there are things\Npeople don't talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.46,0:18:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.60,0:18:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only have one wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.02,0:18:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to make tons of money that I\Ncan use to help the orphanage.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.34,0:18:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My dream is for the\Nchildren and I to be able to
Dialogue: 1,0:18:47.23,0:18:51.23,sign_Arial,text,0,0,0,,{\an9\c&H979A97&\3c&HFBF7F5&\shad0\fs15}Egg Sandwich
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.50,0:18:51.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,eat all the tasty food\Nwe want every single day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.58,0:18:54.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's a simple, Shui kind of wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.46,0:18:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can share mine next if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.68,0:18:59.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My one wish is to somehow\Nmake Boxxo human again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.12,0:19:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, that's sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.30,0:19:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, does that mean that you and\NBoxo share the same wish, cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.30,0:19:05.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.21,0:19:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a lot of them, but\Nwe'll leave it at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.04,0:19:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since we're sharing,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.26,0:19:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have been yearning to share my\Nown deepest desire with you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.90,0:19:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, thank you, Heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.50,0:19:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that simply won't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.26,0:19:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How uncouth would it be to listen\Nto my comrades pour out their
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.94,0:19:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,souls while keeping my own feelings\Nlocked away in my heart of hearts?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.26,0:19:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My wish is to collect footwear\Nfrom all over the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.10,0:19:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the moment just before it wears out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.00,0:19:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and use said footwear to construct\Na vast and ornate castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.52,0:19:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And for the next phase of my dream plan,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.72,0:19:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the end of each year, I\Nshall tax my constituents?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.12,0:19:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,collecting footwear they've worn\Nthroughout the preceding months.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.98,0:19:41.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is the most depraved\Nwish I've heard in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.30,0:19:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess it's our turn next.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.32,0:19:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You all probably know that Shiro and\NI share a common wish as well, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.26,0:19:48.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, Akka.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.17,0:19:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so our most ardent wish is this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.24,0:19:52.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be popular with the ladies!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.54,0:19:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's rich coming\Nfrom a couple of virgins.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.26,0:19:59.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.46,0:20:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about the captain and vice-captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.60,0:20:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.68,0:20:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I asked them about it once upon a\Ntime, but they dodged the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.90,0:20:07.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.00,0:20:08.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.44,0:20:11.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every person has their secrets, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.12,0:20:14.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no sense in\Ntrying to ferret them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.02,0:20:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heavy can be pretty insightful when\Nhe's not being weird about shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.12,0:20:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, enough chit-chat, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.32,0:20:23.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up if you want to get\Nback to the village today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.90,0:20:24.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.42,0:20:28.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excellent work, all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.62,0:20:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo, may I trouble you to provide us with\Nfood and drinks for a celebratory feast?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.90,0:20:33.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:34.12,0:20:35.96,sign_TimesNewRoman,text (blue cans),0,0,0,,{\an7\c&HF9FBF9&\3c&H867638&\shad0}Super {\c&HF8D3A8&}Ice
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.50,0:20:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, looks so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.88,0:20:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.38,0:20:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy and Hunters!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.26,0:20:43.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.74,0:20:48.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, now to attempt something I've\Nbeen wanting to try for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.64,0:20:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Warm change!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:49.31,0:20:52.06,sign_Arial,text,0,0,0,,{\an3\c&H9EA0BB&\3c&H151958&\shad0\fs15\pos(377,97)\fad(521,1)}Koshihikari\NNo-Wash Rice
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.98,0:20:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A rice vending machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.38,0:20:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I have telekinesis,\NI can even prepare it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.68,0:20:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.74,0:20:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, how will I cook this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.78,0:21:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Boxxo, what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.84,0:21:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cookery, right? I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.08,0:21:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.64,0:21:09.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.62,0:21:10.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.18,0:21:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Form change?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.54,0:21:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A gas vending machine!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:13.54,0:21:15.96,sign_Arial,text,0,0,0,,{\c&H616C76&\3c&HBEC9C7&\shad0\fs8\frz-21.04\fax0.38\pos(246,205)}Gas Vending Machine
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.82,0:21:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, eight. There! Like this? Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.58,0:21:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is a magic\Nitem that produces fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.52,0:21:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did get some help at the end, but\NI think I can handle simple cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.28,0:21:29.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, Boxxo, why did you start\Ncooking all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.96,0:21:31.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.42,0:21:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can already dispense\Nall kinds of food.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.30,0:21:37.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do I tell them I\Ntried it just for kicks?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.34,0:21:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And with that, the rice is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.20,0:21:43.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go get some bowls.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.64,0:21:45.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll help you with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.48,0:21:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is so tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.32,0:21:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, tasty is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.52,0:21:53.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I did was cook using my abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.48,0:21:57.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm really satisfied\Nwith myself right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.60,0:22:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Boxo, thanks for all that you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.28,0:22:03.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I might cook\Nagain from time to time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.42,0:22:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll walk you through the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.44,0:22:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.52,0:22:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to walk you\Nthrough the next day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.76,0:22:53.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to change the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.90,0:22:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This melody is the words of the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.28,0:23:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're moving on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.46,0:23:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to keep my own life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.08,0:23:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.48,0:23:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.90,0:23:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could even win a reward.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.06,0:23:40.05,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text (upper left),0,0,0,,{\pos(50,60)\fs14}Next Time
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.06,0:23:40.05,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text (lower right),0,0,0,,{\an1\fs21\pos(468.2,297.8)\fscx80}Sweet Temptation
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.84,0:23:39.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again.

